_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/1b8db80fc49d584f9008dae381c5f7bc.webp?t=1787088129\" width=130 height=18 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take down</strong> <strong>the Herbert empire</strong>’s hold on New Camden. To achieve this, you’ll need to dive into the countryside's mysteries  and explore the many paths that will lead its people to <strong>freedom… or doom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/3d20065336162f5cd4dc1af285e61b5d.webp?t=1787088129\" width=32 height=32 /></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/7118156c75ef3570182e0a093c77001c.webp?t=1787088129\" width=32 height=32 /></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/9394d74bf2c6476e306501d835ee81e3.webp?t=1787088129\" width=32 height=32 /></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/487e925f18f31b27a18a2f3b4d151e1f.webp?t=1787088129\" width=32 height=32 /></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/fc883990b06e5be230779987b5429f2d.webp?t=1787088129\" width=32 height=32 /></span>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5027990/extras/dfd061ce0120aa29ed2